ot;: &quot;Sub lay mesh is placed between the fascial layers or immediately extraperitoneally&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;No mesh can be placed intraperitoneally&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;D. No mesh can be placed intraperitoneally&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (D)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/59499721705987730/59499721705987730.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;True about the statements about inguinal canal are all except?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Roof of the canal is formed by the conjoined tendon&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Anterior wall is formed by the external oblique aponeurosis&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Superficial inguinal ring is a defect in the external oblique aponeurosis&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Deep inguinal ring is a defect in the transversus abdominis muscle&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;D. Deep inguinal ring is a defect in the transversus abdominis muscle&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (D)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/55690051705987872/55690051705987872.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;True about bo