ge B. Often incidental finding at operation C. Young patient has more aggressive disease D. Left sided colon involvement is more common E. Operation is not done for all patients&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;A, C and E&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;B and C&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;A and D&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;D and E&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;D. D and E&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (C) (D &amp;amp; E)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/71362231704872942/71362231704872942.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;True regarding colovesical fistula is: (LQ)&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Commonly presents with pneumaturia&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Barium enema is diagnostic&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Common in Females&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;May be a surgical complication&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;A. Commonly presents with pneumaturia&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (A)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;vide