uot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;APC gene&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;D. APC gene&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (D)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/14955041704879475/14955041704879475.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;Premalignant conditions is/are:&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Ulcerative colitis&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Amoebic colitis&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Familial polyposis coli&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Juvenile polyp&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;E&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Peutz-Jeghers syndrome&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;Unknown&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (A &amp;amp; C)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/56697291704879504/56697291704879504.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;Based on epidemiological studies, which of the following has been found to be most protective against carcinoma colon? (LQ&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;High fiber diet&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Low fat diet&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}