_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;The picture shown below depicts a renal anomaly. Which of the following is not true of this condition:&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Flower vase appearance in IVP&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Ureteral obstruction common&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Heminephrectomy improves function&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Lower calyx is reversed&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;C. Heminephrectomy improves function&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [&quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/course_file_meta/121838911.jpg&quot;], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;The given radiograph in a neonate is diagnostic of:&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Ileal perforation&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Necrotising enterocolitis&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Meconium ileus&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Colonic aganglionosis&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;B. Necrotising enterocolitis&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [&quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/course_file_meta/417646512.jpg&quot;], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quo