 the instrument shown below that is used to create a pneumoperitoneum ?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Veress needle&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Salah’s needle&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Hasson Trocar&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Von Graefe needle&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;A. Veress needle&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [&quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/ckfinder/files/2(755).png&quot;], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;A surgeon is performing an open cholecystectomy and uses the following instrument to lift the liver up. Identify the given instrument.&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Czerny’s retractor&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Morris retractor&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Deaver’s retractor&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Dyball retractor&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;C. Deaver’s retractor&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [&quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/ckfinder/files/3(674).png&quot;], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;A patient was received in the casualty following a road traffic accident. His BP was 90/60 mmHg and his pulse rate was 120/min. The emergency room physician asked you to replace the fluid loss in this patient. What is the maximum flow rate of fluid with the IV canula given in the image?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;60 ml/min&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;90 ml/min&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;180 ml/min&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;240 ml/min&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;B. 90 ml/min&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [&quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/ckfinder/files/4(623).png&quot;], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;For what purpose would you use the instrument shown in the image?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;To carry out blunt dissection&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;To clamp bleeding vessels&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;To hold structures like bowel&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;To hold tough tissue like skin and fascia&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;A. To carry out blunt dissection&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [&quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/ckfinder/files/5(596).png&quot;], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;A diabetic patient presents with sudden-onset perineal pain. On examination, foul-smelling discharge, and necrotic tissue as seen in the image is noted. Which of the following is true about the given condition?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Anti-gas gangrene serum indicated for all cases&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Urinary diversion is the next step&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Bilateral orchidectomy must be done&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Mixed aerobic and anaerobic infection&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;D. Mixed aerobic and anaerobic infection&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [&quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/ckfinder/files/6(486).png&quot;], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;A peripherally Inserted central catheter line(PICC) was placed in a patient to provide parenteral nutrition. Following the insertion, a chest X-ray was taken, which appeared as shown in the image below. Which of the following is the ideal position of the tip of this catheter?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Superior vena cava&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Internal jugular vein&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Subclavian vein&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Inferior vena cava&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer