ue regarding testicular tumors ? (LQ)&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Are embryonal cell carcinomas in 95% of cases&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Bilateral in upto 10% cases&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Teratomas are more common than seminomas&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;None of the above&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;D. None of the above&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (D)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/56363361706524295/56363361706524295.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;Which of the following is true about seminoma?&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;It is radiosensitive&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;It arises only from cryptorchid testis&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;AFP is increased&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;It is chemosensitive&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;A. It is radiosensitive&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (A)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/35643781706524339/35643781706524339.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;Testis tumour is associated with secondary hydrocele in:&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;1% of cases&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;10% of cases&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;20% of cases&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;30% of cases&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;B. 10% of cases&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (B)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.net/dqb_vod/1511311706524355/1511311706524355.m3u8&quot;}, {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;Carcinoma testis, the lymphatic metastasis goes to the first site seen in: (LQ)&quot;, &quot;options&quot;: [{&quot;label&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Para-aortic lymph nodes&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: true}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Superficial inguinal nodes&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;C&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Deep inguinal nodes&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}, {&quot;label&quot;: &quot;D&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Internal iliac nodes&quot;, &quot;correct&quot;: false}], &quot;correct_answer&quot;: &quot;A. Para-aortic lymph nodes&quot;, &quot;question_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation_images&quot;: [], &quot;explanation&quot;: &quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer (A)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@dams_new_robot&lt;/p&gt;&quot;, &quot;bot&quot;: &quot;@dams_new_robot&quot;, &quot;video&quot;: &quot;https://d2enu63wt1sf3u.cloudfront.